<title>GERMANY: LINDE TO BUILD PLANT FOR RICHTER .</title>
<headline>LINDE TO BUILD PLANT FOR RICHTER .</headline>
<dateline>WIESBADEN, Germany 1997-02-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>German engineering group Linde AG said on Wednesday it has won a contract to build a new 100 million mark pharmaceutical plant in Hungary for Gedeon Richter AG .</p>
<p>Linde said the contract lasts through 2000.</p>
<p>--Frankfurt Newsroom, +49 69 756525</p>
